    native_text_literal_brace_escape_unprocessed_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 work/bug-native-brace-escape-20261126: root cause is the CoreLexer verbatim brace-region copy, plus a missing backslash-brace escape row (same root as native_string_backslash_brace_escape_kept_2026-11-26). Unit spec red 3/5 then 5/6, green 7/7. The cuda_fill_u32 line 41 PTX value is byte-identical to the interpreter's. Native red on integ25 Stage 2: LEN=17 vs 15. Native green pending a rebuilt compiler, so status stays open."
    native_text_literal_brace_escape_unprocessed_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-27 w4-1: closed remaining CoreLexer brace+quote parity gap in src/compiler/10.frontend/core/lexer_struct.spl:1147 (la_literal_brace includes la_is_quote when interpolating, matching Rust seed strings.rs:330,339). Verified sequentially via simple.exe --mode=interpreter: lexer_brace_escape_literal_value_spec.spl 12/12 PASS (incl. core_interpret), string_interp_brace_escape_spec.spl 6/6, interp_brace_literal_collision_spec.spl 11/11, lexer_spec.spl 4/4, lexer_comprehensive_spec.spl 3/3, lsp_transport_json_builders_spec.spl 2/2, fstring_brace_concat_spec.spl 2/2, string_escaped_backslash_spec.spl 5/5. waiting-for: Stage-2 native binary rebuild + native run of src/app/test/brace_escape_probe.spl confirming LEN=15."

